---
// Meet Lauren — PROTO C: "poster" (Aug 28 reference #2: choose-yourself-first
// editorial poster — the photo IS the frame, the quote overlays mid-frame,
// and a small credits paragraph sits bottom-right over the image). Layout
// follows the reference; styling stays STAND: the KidMoment recipe carries
// the text (black ground + dimmed photo, cream Editorial New quote).
// The business-school line is lifted from the one-pager's approved copy.
---

<section class="fc-lauren-c" id="meet-lauren" aria-labelledby="lauren-title-c">
  <img
    class="photo"
    src="/brand/lauren.webp"
    alt="Lauren, founder and CEO of STAND, in front of a bookshelf"
    loading="lazy"
    width="1280"
    height="720"
  />

  <blockquote class="quote" data-rv style="--rvi: 0">
    <p id="lauren-title-c">
      &ldquo;I didn&rsquo;t go to
      <span class="line2">business school.</span>
      <span class="line3">I just did business.&rdquo;</span>
    </p>
  </blockquote>

  <p class="caption" data-rv style="--rvi: 1">
    Meet Lauren, founder &amp; CEO of STAND. She co-founded The Wing, led
    business development at ClassPass, and was the first employee at the
    fitness brand SLT &mdash; a career of building consumer businesses from
    zero to scale.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  /* The poster frame: black ground + dimmed photo keeps the overlaid type
     legible over the bright bookshelf (the KidMoment scrim recipe). */
  .fc-lauren-c {
    position: relative;
    height: clamp(560px, 92vh, 920px);
    background: var(--stand-black);
  }

  .photo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    /* Keep Lauren (just left of frame center) and her face in the crop. */
    object-position: 47% 20%;
    opacity: 0.72;
  }

  .quote {
    position: absolute;
    left: clamp(24px, 6vw, 96px);
    top: 34%;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .quote p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5.4vw, 84px);
    line-height: 1.06;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--stand-cream);
  }

  /* Stepped lines, like the reference's ragged left block. */
  .line2 {
    display: block;
    padding-left: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 44px);
  }

  .line3 {
    display: block;
  }

  .caption {
    position: absolute;
    right: clamp(24px, 5vw, 72px);
    bottom: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 64px);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 38ch;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(12px, 1vw, 14px);
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--stand-cream);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .fc-lauren-c {
      height: auto;
      min-height: 640px;
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    }

    .quote {
      top: 28%;
    }

    .caption {
      left: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
